{"parentUuid":"f1f801c9-516a-407c-afbb-5c712801ab88","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa8a84ced372be8dd","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_01cLasXyk64SLLt309zOGnbg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Visibility is computed in `src/renderer/canvas/culling.js` `visibleCards(cards, vp, margin=120)`. The viewport (`viewport.js` `makeViewport`) has width/height/panX/panY in **screen px** and `zoom`; the camera maps `screen = world * zoom + pan`, and `toWorld` divides by zoom. `visibleCards` compares card world coordinates against `-panX .. -panX + width` without dividing by zoom, i.e. it mixes screen px with world units. Called once per frame from `CanvasView.jsx` (`const shown = visibleCards(cards, vp)`)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2270,"cache_read_input_tokens":30100,"output_tokens":134,"service_tier":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CVhz52yzg1gAAxO17cE3e","type":"assistant","uuid":"5f292290-d52c-4e59-980a-bb337cc50083","timestamp":"2026-09-02T05:41:43.565Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/divadbaroon/Desktop/engelbart-canvas","sessionId":"a2f80be0-c548-4c0f-add0-bdf6bd4a276f","version":"2.1.246","gitBranch":"fix/canvas-zoom-cull"}
